# London School Chat — Core Rules

## Stack (do not upgrade in feature work)

- Laravel 5.6, PHP 7.1+
- Vue 2.5, Laravel Mix 2, node-sass 4
- MySQL 5.7, Pusher, Docker

## Forbidden in new code

- PHP 8+ syntax (typed properties, match, named args, union types)
- Laravel 8+ features (facades/helpers not in 5.6)
- Vue 3 Composition API, Vite
- Breaking existing private chat or token login flows

## Code style

- Match existing controller patterns in `SimulationController.php`, `MessageController.php`
- Use Eloquent/models already in `app/`
- Keep changes minimal and focused
- No unrelated refactors in the same PR

## Testing

- PHPUnit 7 in `tests/`
- Run: `docker compose exec app vendor/bin/phpunit`
- Mock external services (OpenAI, S3, Pusher) in tests

## Docs

- Feature specs live in `.cursor/features/`
- Agent personas in `.cursor/agents/`
